# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Vite reads these to turn on the read-only public showcase
# (VITE_DEMO_MODE=true) on the `demo` branch — no secret, safe to commit.
# Both modes are needed: .env.production for `vite build` (the real
# deployment), .env.development for `npm run dev` (local testing of this
# branch) — Vite only loads the file matching the command's mode.
!apps/web/.env.production
!apps/web/.env.development
devflow-local-gh-app*

